# Web 静态资源统一 LF：跨平台一致、体积更小，并消除 core.autocrlf=true 下 LF↔CRLF 转换的 warning
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源（禁止任何换行或内容转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
